        "title": "Ramgai neihlaa liangpui lat nuhlo",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ramgai neihla liangpui lat nuhlo,",
            "Kandi khou rui phaengzau lana;",
            "Ai bamni e ramgai khou tei,",
            "Kandi lungh rianra tuanpu khou,",
            "Ai bamni e hei ramgai khou.",
            "",
            "Rianramei abumaeng tatro,",
            "Kanloumeipu Poubaomei Jisu thei laina;",
            "Nang paap nritmei guai kandi khou hei lou du lana,",
            "Ramgai tei nzuanna tatro, tatro.",
            "",
            "2. Ning e gaina bammei nun ram tei,",
            "Ramgai zauna lu suanpui bam;",
            "Samthai e thei ngumzaina kum,",
            "Sam kanni e ramgai zuanna,",
            "Ringhpui thingbang khou sam tangni.",
            "",
            "3. Ringhpui tingmik tei ningtou pukhou,",
            "Kandih rianramei rui gumliam;",
            "Ai lung geic mei guay hei maan khang,",
            "Kanloumei nah bam phuna,",
            "He! Abumaeng le sam tatro."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
